	(text "MASTER VERSION of the LM3916 meter card, two copies (L = x1xx, R = x2xx). Changes from the aux meter card:\n- LEDs: Lumex 4 x 7 mm (SSL-LX4673GD/YD/ID-LA20, 6.15 x 3.65 mm top, 2.54 mm leads), on the board side facing the panel.\n- CLIP LED driver resized for ~19 mA: R126/R226 150R (was 330R), R124/R224 68k (was 150k, more base drive for Q102/Q202),\n  R125/R225 220k (was 100k, keeps the ~0.3 s fade with the smaller R124).\n- Bar LED current is set by RV103/RV203 with R114/R214 1.5k: about 8 to 22 mA. Keep it at 20 mA or less (green LED: 25 mA max;\n  at 20 mA x 10 LEDs the LM3916 dissipates about 0.6 W).\n- Resistors and capacitors are SMD (0603, C101/C201 0805, 2.2 uF and 10 uF 1206), assembled by JLCPCB with the aux card LCSC numbers;\n  new values: 150R C22808, 68k C23231. R127/R227 are do-not-fit 0603s. Fitted by hand: LEDs, LM3916 sockets, trimmers, headers.\n- Power entry fitted once: J101 (+/-15 V), J102 (+5 V), C111/C112. Audio: J103 (L) and J203 (R).\n- Buffer gain x2 (R128/R129, R228/R229) as on the aux cards: 0 dB lamp at -2 dBu in (+4 dBu equivalent)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 330.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c7380e72-4c1c-4fce-bfa5-5c73933ddfea")
	)
	(text "Fig. 3 half-wave peak detector, with D201 replaced by Q201B (diode-connected half of the MMDT3906)\nso its drop tracks Q201A's Vbe on the same die. \nR15 (to +15 V): Q201A emitter pull-up and C201 charge current. \nR17: Q201A base stopper.\nRelease ~ R219 x C201 = 0.68 s. R218 limits pin 5 current.\nD2 clamps the hold node near 5.5 V, \nso Q201B's emitter-base junction (V_EBO = 5 V) never breaks down on negative half-cycles."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 400.386 170.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c8b78d98-df66-46e0-8344-9a7a114a36a8")
	)
	(text "Supply current per card: +5 V 100-200 mA at full scale (LM3916 + LEDs); +15 V ~3 mA; -15 V ~2 mA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 33.274 257.302 0)
		(effects
			(font
